        <mxCell id="jwZVE05a1n1PSdnAtXqr-5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBFBEA;strokeColor=#7A7A7A;dashed=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;" value="Attention threshold \(= 0.35\).&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;A region is attended with \(\sigma = 1.00\) when \(p_i \ge 0.35\,p_{max}\) or \(p_i \ge 0.35\); otherwise it is monitored with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;\(\sigma = 0.5 + 0.5\,(p_i/p_{max})\).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;The share scales only the monitored region; the focus and its budget follow the priority ranking.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
